+## WorkNexus-DSH distribution / WorkNexus-DSH 发行版
+
+This repository is also the base of the **WorkNexus-DSH** enterprise distribution
+(built on DeepSeek Harness, pinned to `dsh-v0.2.0-rc.1`). It keeps upstream behaviour unchanged and
+adds brand and packaging differences only — product name, installer artifact name, UI copy and
+placeholder icons. Licences and `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` are untouched.
+
+Release notes, the branding diff summary and the explicit "not changed" guarantees live in
+[WORKNEXUS-RELEASE-NOTES.md](WORKNEXUS-RELEASE-NOTES.md).
